# Everything Unreal builds or caches
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
.vs/
*.sln

# Generated by Scripts/build.cmd from the game's export and the downloaded scans; rebuildable at any time
Content/

# Inputs produced or fetched by the steps in README.md: the game's exports (one per car, 125 MB each, over GitHub's
# file limit) and what build.cmd cuts from them, the scatter list and the downloaded scans.
Import/*.glb
Import/*.json
Import/PolyHaven/
Import/Decals/
Import/Models/*.glb
__pycache__/
Import/track_v8_ue.glb
Import/car_v8.glb

# NVIDIA's DLSS plugins, unzipped from NVIDIA's download (README, step 4): third-party, 280 MB, not versioned here
Plugins/DLSS/
Plugins/DLSSMoviePipelineSupport/
Plugins/StreamlineNGXCommon/
